
anchor Prompt_1c8be86985227e78:
    userPrompt:
        When doing the agentic ctrl+p search, the priority should be the spec directory, then the src, then the .suspense directory, then the .claude directory.  This should be included in that system prompt, and src and spec should be read from the piton.config.pi and injected into the prompt

    systemPrompt:
        We're working on the code located in ./src. Don't edit the spec located in ./spec.
